            "value" : "The detail to apply, cause by cause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le fer contribue à réduire la fatigue et au transport normal de l'oxygène dans l'organisme." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Iron contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue and to normal oxygen transport in the body."
